@startuml
title Role-scoped Analytics Sequence
actor User
participant "Unified Workspace" as UI
participant "Analytics API" as API
participant "Scope Resolver" as Scope
participant "Authorisation Service" as Authz
database "PostgreSQL RLS" as DB

User -> UI : Open Insights
UI -> API : GET /analytics/overview(scope, period)
API -> Scope : resolve(active role, requested scope)
alt lecturer or reviewer
  Scope --> API : force user scope
else HOD or coordinator
  Scope --> API : require organisational unit
else institution administrator
  Scope --> API : permit institution or authorised unit
else unsupported role/scope
  Scope --> API : deny
  API --> UI : 403
end
API -> Authz : require resolved permission and scope
Authz -> DB : validate role assignment and scope
DB --> Authz : authorised
Authz --> API : allow
API -> DB : tenant-filtered metrics query
DB --> API : authorised aggregates
API -> DB : write immutable analytics snapshot
API --> UI : cards, series, alerts, data notes
UI --> User : display scope and period
@enduml
